,"date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-16T08:20:56-08:00","id":1555496,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AFGcHkm4hO8\" target=\"_blank\">The Price of Pokrovsk: 110,000 Russian Soldiers CRUSHED by Ukrainian Force</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-16T08:27:29-08:00","id":1555497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samuelalpha86</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1554363-the-war-in-ukraine-has-surprising-potential-for-lore?p=1555061#post1555061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's with all the downvotes?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think a lot of people are really opposed to making this topic part of the World of Darkness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":26996,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","user":"Amethyst","date":". 11-16-2025, 04:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-16T09:09:29-08:00","id":1555498,"title":"","content":"I think plenty of other people on this thread have already explained that making the current Ukraine war the setting for a WtA scenario seems like a bad idea. Personally, I think creating a more fictional scenario inspired by the Ukraine war (maybe with fictional nations) would be better. Especially since it's hard to find a complete, nuanced analysis of an ongoing conflict. Hindsight is 20/20, as they say. So either go with a fictional conflict or go back to historical ones. That's my recommendation.<br /> <br /> And to add something of worth to this thread. Here's a bit from the Ukraine war that I thought would be interesting for a WtA-game (from Forbes): <a href=\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/davidhambling/2025/06/06/fiber-optic-birds-nest-heralds-a-fiber-drone-summer-in-ukraine/\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;Fiber Optic Bird\u2019s Nest Heralds A Fiber Drone Summer In Ukraine&quot;</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A bird\u2019s nest incorporating fiber optic cable is a striking sign of how much debris from fiber-guided FPVs now litters the landscape of Ukraine. Other images show fields glittering with fibers like spiderwebs where dozens of drones have passed overhead. Meanwhile social media fills with hide-and-seek videos as Ukrainian drone pilots use their new ability to go inside buildings to hunt Russian vehicles.The non-toxic fibers may not harm birds, but they signal extreme danger to humans. Fiber drone summer is starting. </div> </div> </div>It didn't just immediately make me think of the Weaver, of course, but this story got it all: War, technology, nature and the environment. I think something like this is the perfect jumping-off-point for a WtA-scenario. And I think this would allow the focus to go more in the direction of a &quot;War is hell&quot;-theme rather than getting mired in the mud of politics. The environmental angle combined with the technological aspects also makes it suitable for a WtA-game. And it doesn't have to be the current Ukraine war. Because it's not about that, really. It's about how a new development in drone-warfare is impacting the environment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-16T10:56:24-08:00","id":1555501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samuelalpha86</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1554363-the-war-in-ukraine-has-surprising-potential-for-lore?p=1555061#post1555061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's with all the downvotes?</div> </div> </div> </div>While I can't be sure, you've been warned repeatedly that this is a sensible topic and extremely nuanced.<br /> <br /> Yet it seems by the looks of the posts you doubled down on <i>everything</i> you've been warned against.<br /> <br /> Seriously, what did you expect?\u200b<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1554363-the-war-in-ukraine-has-surprising-potential-for-lore?p=1555498#post1555498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think something like this is the perfect jumping-off-point for a WtA-scenario. And I think this would allow the focus to go more in the direction of a &quot;War is hell&quot;-theme rather than getting mired in the mud of politics. The environmental angle combined with the technological aspects also makes it suitable for a WtA-game. And it doesn't have to be the current Ukraine war. Because it's not about that, really. It's about how a new development in drone-warfare is impacting the environment.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've seen this article when it was out and it's very interesting. And overall I agree.<br /> <br /> There are plenty of ways to actually use the war in a WtA game, it's just a matter of steering away from sides and politics and focusing on collateral effects, especially environmental. That would be more sensible and more adequate for WtA.<br /> <br /> But it still demands a lot of research and care to not step on anyone's toes. The optic fiber nests are a wonderful starting point, though, as far as it goes.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-16T13:15:14-08:00","id":1555503,"title":"","content":"The fiber optics in nests thing is, also, something one could detach from the specific war that inspired it as needed. There's a lot of drones out there in general, and the accumulation of poorly handled human waste in bird nets is basically a whole sub-field of ecology at this point given how much it can show about the current impact humans are having in their local ecosystems.<br /> <br /> -----------<br /> <br /> On the downvotes, I would assume that the link-fest started very much feeling like the thread was morphing into a &quot;sensational&quot; news from the war thread. It makes the initial links to the animals within the exclusion zone feel less food-for-thought and more tone setting from discussion to posting links more broadly (also there was no real attempt to explain why any given story of the impact of the radiation on animals was specifically worth thinking about for WtA broadly or WtA involved the war for concepts directly involved). But downvotes don't really give people a chance to explain themselves unless they choose to, so I could be completely wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T07:34:08-08:00","id":1555528,"title":"","content":"The links were for background. To understand the current trajectory of the war and the conditions of both armies and how they operate. The links about the animals in the exclusion zone was to give ideas for possible Fomori.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T09:30:28-08:00","id":1555535,"title":"","content":"For example, through the links we know that Russians are looting everything including dangerous or even radioactive objects and the Russian government duped foreigners into fighting for them. Some Russians are attacking on horseback maybe the Aughisky makes a comeback? Ukraine is using robots so maybe Shinzui Industries gets involved?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 11-17-2025, 12:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T10:24:26-08:00","id":1555540,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samuelalpha86</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1554363-the-war-in-ukraine-has-surprising-potential-for-lore?p=1555528#post1555528\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The links were for background. To understand the current trajectory of the war and the conditions of both armies and how they operate. The links about the animals in the exclusion zone was to give ideas for possible Fomori.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll give you the benefit of the doubt for now and assume you're not understanding your own bubble.<br /> <br /> Those links don't help understand the trajectory of the war, because they're one-sided. They're <i>extremely</i> biased, everyone noticed that.<br /> <br /> By the way, Ukraine is <i>also</i> duping foreigners into fighting for them, we're having <u><b>a lot</b></u> of problems with that in Latin America. Some cases are straight-up human trafficking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T11:14:53-08:00","id":1555543,"title":"","content":"They're not biased. The Russians literally took years and don't have much land to show for it they're throwing people in waves with barely any tactics whatsoever. Do you want me to post something that says Russians are doing a good job or that they're being reasonable?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 11-17-2025, 02:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T12:09:11-08:00","id":1555545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samuelalpha86</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1554363-the-war-in-ukraine-has-surprising-potential-for-lore?p=1555543#post1555543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They're not biased. The Russians literally took years and don't have much land to show for it they're throwing people in waves with barely any tactics whatsoever. Do you want me to post something that says Russians are doing a good job or that they're being reasonable?</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, one reason why one wouldn't want to use a current, ongoing conflict as a backdrop for a game is because one might encounter someone like you. You come off as extremely biased and someone who's personally heavily invested in that extremely biased narrative. I mean, holy shit... &quot;The Russians&quot;, &quot;barely any tactics whatsoever&quot;, &quot;looting everything including radioactive objects&quot;... that's just chauvinism. Acting like the entire Russian army are just a bunch of unthinking, non-human orcs isn't a realistic or nuanced perspective. Sure, you can criticize Russia for being the aggressor in this conflict and Putin was rightly charged by the ICC - but we shouldn't dehumanize the entire Russian people in the process of that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T12:27:04-08:00","id":1555546,"title":"","content":"They're literally throwing people in waves, to the point both sides are calling it a meat-grinder, how is that tactical in any way? Pairing that with the numerous Russian war crimes, people started calling them &quot;Orcs.&quot; The only thing that is tactical is Russia's use of drones on power stations. Also, yes they actually took radioactive objects from Chernobyl research labs as stated in one of the videos, stating that the possible reason why is because many soldiers are taken from the uneducated, poor parts of Russia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":".  punctuation and details 11-17-2025, 04:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T12:50:50-08:00","id":1555548,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samuelalpha86</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1554363-the-war-in-ukraine-has-surprising-potential-for-lore?p=1555546#post1555546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They're literally throwing people in waves, how is that tactical in any way? Also, yes they actually took radioactive objects as stated in one of the videos.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, there's the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_wave_attack\" target=\"_blank\">human wave attack</a>, of course. So yes, that is a tactic. It even has a section on the Ukraine-war already and how the tactic has been used there.<br /> <br /> But that's besides the point anyway... There's more going on in the Ukraine-war than that, of course.<br /> <br /> Let's just turn to an article I offer here from November 16 (from Agence France Presse): <a href=\"https://www.barrons.com/news/russia-claims-to-have-seized-two-new-villages-in-southern-ukraine-52486d8d\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;Russia Claims To Have Seized Two New Villages In Southern Ukraine&quot;</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The Russian army on Sunday claimed to have captured two more villages in southern Ukraine, where its troops are slowly gaining ground against outnumbered Ukrainian forces.<br /> <br /> On Telegram, the Russian Ministry of Defence said its troops had taken Rivnopillia and Mala Tokmachka in the Zaporizhzhia region.<br /> <br /> Although the Zaporizhzia frontline is much less active than the eastern front, where most of the fighting occurs, Russian forces that are better equipped and more numerous than their opponents are advancing in both regions.<br /> <br /> Fighting in the east centres around control of the key logistical hub Pokrovsk, which hundreds of Russian soldiers have infiltrated in recent weeks, weakening Ukrainian defences.<br /> <br /> Peace talks between Kyiv and Moscow are currently deadlocked, and a planned Budapest summit between US President Donald Trump and his Russian counterpart Vladimir Putin did not go ahead. </div> </div> </div>This isn't some cheesy good vs. evil story, it's a real war. And it's an ongoing conflict. So you can't just rely on one-sided perspectives on the war to determine how it's going.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T12:58:08-08:00","id":1555549,"title":"","content":"While I am aware that Russians have dressed as civilians to sabotage Ukrainian positions I wouldn't exactly call the Russians &quot;better equipped.&quot; More numerous sure, but they lack supplies to an almost criminal extent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":".  punctuation 11-17-2025, 04:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T13:09:30-08:00","id":1555550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samuelalpha86</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1554363-the-war-in-ukraine-has-surprising-potential-for-lore?p=1555549#post1555549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I am aware that Russians have dressed as civilians to sabotage Ukrainian positions I wouldn't exactly call the Russians &quot;better equipped&quot;. More numerous sure but they lack supplies to an almost criminal extent.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, whatever helps you sleep at night...<br /> <br /> The point is that this is supposed to be a thread about whether using the current Ukraine war as backdrop for a WtA-game is a good idea or not. And this exchange proves, in my opinion, that it's a bad idea. Because this is what it will end up becoming: A debate about the Ukraine-war that goes nowhere. And what you're not gonna get is a good session of WtA.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T13:16:44-08:00","id":1555551,"title":"","content":"The Russians are literally so desperate as to use dated equipment from the Soviet era, some of which is defective.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.newsweek.com/russia-ground-forces-poorly-trained-antiquated-equipment-ukraine-counteroffensive-bakhmut-1800153\" target=\"_blank\">Russia\u2019s Ground Forces Poorly Trained and Using Antiquated Equipment: U.K. - Newsweek</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 11-17-2025, 04:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T13:20:17-08:00","id":1555552,"title":"","content":"Also, the bombing of children's schools, kidnapping of children and other warcrimes very clearly indicate that Russia is the bad side.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gRaPL4bJ5eg\" target=\"_blank\">Ukraine kindergarten among civilian sites hit by Russian drone and missile strikes</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.politico.eu/article/russia-bomb-kindergarten-kharkiv-ukraine/\" target=\"_blank\">Russia bombs kindergarten in Kharkiv, Ukraine says \u2013 POLITICO</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Child_abductions_in_the_Russo-Ukrainian_war\" target=\"_blank\">Child abductions in the Russo-Ukrainian war - Wikipedia</a>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 11-17-2025, 04:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T13:48:08-08:00","id":1555553,"title":"","content":"The Russians only took those villages because of fog<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cx276px3280o\" target=\"_blank\">Pokrovsk: Russian forces use fog cover to push further into key Ukraine town</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UOrnouTp-1U\" target=\"_blank\">Russian Troops Swarm Pokrovsk in Fog-Covered \u2018Mad Max\u2019 Assault</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 11-17-2025, 04:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T14:10:32-08:00","id":1555554,"title":"","content":"Dude, why are you destroying your own thread?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T14:33:44-08:00","id":1555555,"title":"","content":"I'm not destroying the thread. It's the truth that the Russians have been using horde tactics for the entire war. Now they're using cars and motorcycles to take villages because they lack enough armored vehicles as shown in my last two videos. I don't know why people think I'm being biased for one side?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 11-17-2025, 05:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T15:05:00-08:00","id":1555556,"title":"","content":"While I get that not every Russian soldier is evil since many of them were forced to go and there are some who are deserting. The Russian government is clearly evil for using soldiers as cannon fodder and condoning war crimes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28613,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","user":"Samuelalpha86","date":". 11-17-2025, 06:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28613-samuelalpha86","name":"Samuelalpha86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T16:39:46-08:00","id":1555563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samuelalpha86</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1554363-the-war-in-ukraine-has-surprising-potential-for-lore?p=1555555#post1555555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not destroying the thread.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a discussion forum. A thread is about the conversations we have with each other. You've been posting a bunch of links to the obvious negative response of everyone else in the thread.<br /> <br /> What, exactly, do you think you're accomplishing? Do you think you're making a better case for using the war in a WtA game with any of this? Do you think you're going to &quot;educate&quot; the rest of us about what's happening in the war with stuff none of us are asking to be told about? Do you think anyone that's posted so far to your idea wants to debate Russia's military tactics with you?<br /> <br /> Because I think it's pretty clear that you really need to think about that stuff if you don't want this thread to just being you posting links and the most interaction you get is dislike emotes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T16:47:27-08:00","id":1555564,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Samuelalpha86</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1554363-the-war-in-ukraine-has-surprising-potential-for-lore?p=1555555#post1555555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know why people think I'm being biased for one side?</div> </div> </div> </div>And that's the problem. Everything that could be said was said, and yet you can't figure it out.","signature":"<h