ve the same respect as any other user.</b></u> Overall avoiding veiled political discussion is good. If you want to be political, do it openly, and open to criticism. It is also good to avoid assuming things are self-evident, this is usually more a sign of our own bias than things being really certain.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're suspicious of what, exactly?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-17T17:22:07-08:00","id":1555573,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1554363-the-war-in-ukraine-has-surprising-potential-for-lore?p=1555540#post1555540\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll give you the benefit of the doubt for now and assume you're not understanding your own bubble.<br /> <br /> Those links don't help understand the trajectory of the war, because they're one-sided. They're <i>extremely</i> biased, everyone noticed that.<br /> <br /> By the way, Ukraine is <i>also</i> duping foreigners into fighting for them, we're having <u><b>a lot</b></u> of problems with that in Latin America. Some cases are st